    "reviews": "\u201cNeon Hearts City is a title with a captivating atmosphere and a well-thought-out plot full of twists and turns. Once again, Cosmic Void delights us with an original title and excellent puzzles.\u201d<br>80 \u2013 OneUpNerd<br><br>\u201cNeon Hearts City blends colorful pixel-art graphics, intriguing challenges, excellent voice-overs, and mood-enhancing music to draw adventurers into its darkly exhilarating tale.\u201d<br>80 \u2013 AdventureGamers<br>",
